{"version":1,"content":"<p>經過漫長等待，《俠盜獵車6》終於正式上線。本作中藏有一個趣味彩蛋，既調侃了Rockstar打造本作的漫長開發周期，也呼應了系列的過往淵源與未來規劃。在《GTA6》中，玩家可以在傑森與露西婭的手機裏，打開類似Instagram的社交平台Snapmatic。平台內有海量的帖子、視頻與評論內容，隨着劇情推進還會持續更新，既有玩家對遊戲內事件的討論，也有各類梗圖、陰謀論、搞笑視頻和零散的日常分享。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586984.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:44:08.022156+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:23:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:37:19.748882+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:37:19.748882+00:00","content_hash":"621df39c566781293b9afd6b4ba97467f1501eb0629ded32c0152f316e0a8802","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}